          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قراءة (qirāʾa) is built on the native Arabic root q-r-a, \"to read, to recite\" (Lane). Qirāʾa is the verbal noun of qaraʾa, to read, which you know."
